  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, whenever the bravo is suffering from an emotion-based condition that is caused by a skill use, every 1 round that elapses on the condition’s duration instead counts as 2 rounds.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the DC to affect him with skill checks is increased by 2 + 1 for every 2 bravo levels thereafter he possesses.</p>\n<p>Lastly, the bravo can use his Charisma score in place of Intelligence when determining if he meets the prerequisites for combat feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
